l be able to review the questions you have answered incorrectly only. For additional feedback, please reach out to your instructor.&lt;/p&gt;</mattext></material></flow_mat></rubric><d2l_2p0:duration>0</d2l_2p0:duration><d2l_2p0:response_display_type_id>4</d2l_2p0:response_display_type_id><d2l_2p0:show_correct_answers>no</d2l_2p0:show_correct_answers><d2l_2p0:submission_restrictip>no</d2l_2p0:submission_restrictip><d2l_2p0:show_class_average>no</d2l_2p0:show_class_average><d2l_2p0:show_score_distribution>no</d2l_2p0:show_score_distribution></assessfeedback><section ident="CONTAINER_SECTION"><selection_ordering><order order_type="Random" /></selection_ordering><section title="Random Section #_4749881_1" d2l_2p0:page="1" ident="RAND_44321"><qtimetadata><qti_metadatafield><fieldlabel>qmd_numberofitems</fieldlabel><fieldentry>4</fieldentry></qti_metadatafield><qti_metadatafield><fieldlabel>qmd_weighting</fieldlabel><fieldentry>3.000000000</fieldentry></qti_metadatafield></qtimetadata><sectionproc_extension><d2l_2p0:display_section_name>no</d2l_2p0:display_section_name><d2l_2p0:display_section_line>no</d2l_2p0:display_section_line><d2l_2p0:type_display_section>0</d2l_2p0:type_display_section></sectionproc_extension><item ident="OBJ_44321" label="QUES_44867_45323" d2l_2p0:page="1" title="Essay Pool 1001"><itemmetadata><qtimetadata><qti_metadatafield><fieldlabel>qmd_computerscored</fieldlabel><fieldentry>yes</fieldentry></qti_metadatafield><qti_metadatafield><fieldlabel>qmd_questiontype</fieldlabel><fieldentry>Long Answer</fieldentry></qti_metadatafield><qti_metadatafield><fieldlabel>qmd_weighting</fieldlabel><fieldentry>3.000000000</fieldentry></qti_metadatafield><qti_metadatafield><fieldlabel>qmd_globalid</fieldlabel><fieldentry>75923650-814a-42c1-9cd1-9a098fb18d93</fieldentry></qti_metadatafield><qti_metadatafield><fieldlabel>qmd_displayid</fieldlabel><fieldentry>OWL-BIOL-1020_20210428020925-5883</fieldentry></qti_metadatafield><qti_metadatafield><fieldlabel>qmd_aihumanorigin</fieldlabel><fieldentry>HumanGenerated</fieldentry></qti_metadatafield></qtimetadata></itemmetadata><itemproc_extension><d2l_2p0:difficulty>1</d2l_2p0:difficulty><d2l_2p0:isbonus>no</d2l_2p0:isbonus><d2l_2p0:ismandatory>no</d2l_2p0:ismandatory></itemproc_extension><presentation><flow><material><mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;!--RsQ_001--&gt;&lt;p&gt;A biofilm is defined as a community of microorganisms attached to an inert or living surface. &lt;br&gt;&amp;#9679;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Describe and explain the relationship between quorum sensing and the establishment of a biofilm. &lt;br&gt;&amp;#9679;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Give one (1) example of a biofilm.&lt;/p&gt;</mattext></material><response_extension><d2l_2p0:has_signed_comments>no</d2l_2p0:has_signed_comments><d2l_2p0:has_htmleditor>no</d2l_2p0:has_htmleditor><d2l_2p0:has_fileupload>no</d2l_2p0:has_fileupload></response_extension><response_str ident="QUES_44867_45323_STR" rcardinality="Multiple"><render_fib rows="8" columns="100" prompt="Box" fibtype="String"><response_label ident="QUES_44867_45323_LA"><material><mattext texttype="text/plain" /></material></response_label></render_fib></response_str></flow></presentation><answer_key><answer_key_material><flow_mat><material><mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;p&gt;Biofilms are a community of microorganisms attached to a surface. Microbial biofilms are complex communities of bacteria and are common in the human body and in the environment. An example is dental plaque. It enhances the bacteria&amp;#8217;s resistance to both the host&amp;#8217;s defense system and antimicrobials. Quorum sensing is the ability to detect and to respond to cell population density by gene regulation. Quorum sensing allows bacteria to synchronize the gene expression of the group and act in unison using an autoinducer. They undergo behaviors that are carried out as a group and could not be done alone.&lt;br&gt;Key Points&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Biofilms&lt;br&gt;are a community of microorganisms&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Common in the human body and in the environment&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Quorum sensing is the ability to detect and to respond to cell population density by gene regulation&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Allows bacteria to synchronize the gene expression of the group&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Some examples of diseases caused by biofilms: dental plaque, otitis media, diabetic wounds, urinary tract infections&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</mattext></material></flow_mat></answer_key_material></answer_key></item></section></section></assessment></questestinterop>